{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834670/extras/af6c1b1aff5bf79ae4c657c7acf0f46b.avif?t=1761937458\" width=600 height=468 /></span><br><br>In the aftermath of a devastating world war, nations unleashed both nuclear and biological weapons, turning the world into a wasteland. The fallout from the biological warfare transformed survivors into zombie-like creatures known as the Fibers. Humanity now clings to survival in isolated pockets, desperately searching for a cure to the deadly virus that morphs them into Fibers. In this post-apocalyptic world, our protagonist emerges as a beacon of hope, venturing into the heart of the origin of the virus. His mission: to find a cure, humanity's last chance against the encroaching darkness. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834670/extras/03e1515e56bce8ac2fbe4246020a9c83.poster.avif?t=1761937458\" width=594 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834670/extras/03e1515e56bce8ac2fbe4246020a9c83.webm?t=1761937458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834670/extras/03e1515e56bce8ac2fbe4246020a9c83.mp4?t=1761937458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Immerse yourself in an open-world action/horror experience where survival is paramount. Navigate through stunning and diverse locations while mastering stealth, utilizing a variety of melee and ranged weapons, gadgets, and grenade types. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834670/extras/276c70c908227c268efe7bd51f217d01.poster.avif?t=1761937458\" width=594 height=334 ><source src=\"http